    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1replication_1_1_cross_cluster_publication" kindref="compound">CrossClusterPublication</ref></para>
<para>Publishes WAL entries to remote cluster subscriptions. Implements <ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1replication_1_1_i_replication_listener" kindref="compound">IReplicationListener</ref> so it can be registered directly with <ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1replication_1_1_replication_manager_1a10e1433302c16db2b07c5101d8a3ab3e" kindref="member">ReplicationManager::addListener()</ref>. Every WAL entry that passes the configured filter is forwarded to all registered remote subscribers.</para>
<para>Usage: auto pub = std::make_shared&lt;CrossClusterPublication&gt;(&quot;orders_pub&quot;); pub-&gt;setFilter(filter); repl_mgr.addListener(pub); pub-&gt;addRemoteSubscriber([](const <ref refid="structthemisdb_1_1replication_1_1_w_a_l_entry" kindref="compound">WALEntry</ref>&amp; e){ remote.apply(e); }); </para>
    </detaileddescription>
